    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i'm just so anxious about going to the er, it's so expensive and the wait is always hours. do you think it's possible it's just a massive tension headache from stress? i've been super stressed lately. maybe i can just take some extra ibuprofen and see if that knocks it down? i really don't want to go to the hospital unless it's like, an absolute emergency.",
